    {
      "ref": "wiki:discipline-acquisition:20260917",
      "url": "https://www.poe2wiki.net/wiki/Discipline",
      "section": "Acquisition",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-17",
      "review": "取得方式明确为不掉落的节杖固有技能；精确 Metadata ID 与已固定 PoB 的 DisciplinePlayer、Stoic Sceptre implicit 交叉核对。仅认证 0.5.5 的普通宝石来源限制，不外推其他零级刻印技能或未来补丁。"
    },
    {
      "ref": "ggg:removed:third-edict",
      "url": "https://www.pathofexile.com/forum/view-thread/3828542/filter-account-type/staff",
      "section": "Removed Items",
      "publishedAt": "2025-08-27",
      "reviewedAt": "2026-09-11",
      "review": "已阅读官方移除清单，逐个绑定37个辅助的精确宝石与效果ID；名称仅用于人工复核。"
    },
    {
      "ref": "pinned:repoe-pob:20260911",
      "corpusSha256": "f9d35fca0ae25e617d8cf730ab80e7425808901bb1f47162e27ba5ae039c89c3",
      "pobGemDataSha256": "2daba2e7aa586fe7669585ff93df25e9bff82a9da1c61f72d1e134886091a0a5",
      "repoeExportedVersion": "4.5.4.11",
      "review": "原始released字段只证明数据发布状态；37个辅助无普通刻印入口。该特征不单独判断移除，Lineage等特殊来源不据此排除。"
    }
  ],
